`s 800(1) the summary conviction court is required to hold the trial` MEANS
    IF `the prosecutor and the defendant appear for the trial`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the prosecutor and defendant appear for the trial"

DECLARE `s 800 action` IS ONE OF
