-- 802.1 Despite subsections 800(2) and 802(2), a defendant may not appear or examine or cross-examine witnesses by agent if he or she is liable, on summary conviction, to imprisonment for a term of more than six months, unless (a) the defendant is an organization; (b) the defendant is appearing to request an adjournment of the proceedings; or (c) the agent is authorized to do so under a program approved -- or criteria established -- by the lieutenant governor in council of the province.
-- src:16781 | Limitation on the use of agents
-- src:16782 | 802.1 Despite subsections 800(2) and 802(2), a defendant may not appear or examine or cross-examine witnesses by agent if he or she is liable, on summary conviction, to imprisonment for a term of more than six months, unless
-- src:16783 | (a) the defendant is an organization;
-- src:16784 | (b) the defendant is appearing to request an adjournment of the proceedings; or
-- src:16785 | (c) the agent is authorized to do so under a program approved — or criteria established — by the lieutenant governor in council of the province.
@ref Criminal Code s 802.1 to s 802.1(c) (src:16781-16785)
GIVEN `the longest term of imprisonment, in months, to which the defendant is liable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER
      `s 2 organization` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the defendant is appearing to request an adjournment of the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the agent is authorized under a program approved or criteria established by the lieutenant governor in council of the province` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 802.1 the defendant is barred from appearing or examining or cross-examining witnesses by agent` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the longest term of imprisonment, in months, to which the defendant is liable on summary conviction` AT MOST 6 THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if he or she is liable, on summary conviction, to imprisonment for a term of more than six months"
        IF `s 2 organization` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "unless (a) the defendant is an organization"
        IF `the defendant is appearing to request an adjournment of the proceedings` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(b) the defendant is appearing to request an adjournment of the proceedings"
        IF `the agent is authorized under a program approved or criteria established by the lieutenant governor in council of the province` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(c) the agent is authorized to do so under a program approved"
        IF `s 2 organization` EQUALS NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "organization" is defined in section 2
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- 803(1) The summary conviction court may, in its discretion, before or during the trial, adjourn the trial to a time and place to be appointed and stated in the presence of the parties or their counsel or agents.
