      `the defendant does not appear for the resumption of a trial adjourned in accordance with subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 803(2)(a) the summary conviction court may proceed ex parte to hear and determine the proceedings in the absence of the defendant` MEANS
    IF `the defendant does not appear at the time and place appointed for the trial after having been notified of that time and place`
       OR `the defendant does not appear for the resumption of a trial adjourned in accordance with subsection (1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If a defendant who is tried alone or together with others does not appear at the time and place appointed for the trial after having been notified"

